---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
permalink: /blog/
eyebrow: Blog
heading: "Idées, coulisses et *retours d'expérience*."
lead: "Ce que j'apprends sur le terrain, en marketing digital et en gestion de projet."
---
{% include "page-hero.njk" %}
<section class="band"><div class="wrap">
  {% if collections.articles.length %}
  <div class="posts">
    {% for post in collections.articles %}
    <a class="post-card rv" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="cover{% if post.data.image %} has-img{% endif %}">{% if post.data.image %}<img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="">{% else %}{{ post.data.title }}{% endif %}</div>
      <div class="body">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date.toISOString() }}">{{ post.date | dateFr }}</time>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty">Les premiers articles arrivent bientôt.</p>
  {% endif %}
</div></section>
